# --- Large / sensitive raw Brandwatch exports: never commit ---
# They are large (often 80MB+) and contain scraped third-party content.
# Small curated fixtures under samples/ ARE committed on purpose.
# (Inline comments are NOT allowed in .gitignore; keep patterns clean.)

# BW raw exports start with a numeric resource/query ID, e.g. 2057989146_SkodaEnyaq.xlsx
[0-9]*.xlsx
**/raw/**
**/*Bulk*Mentions*.xlsx
**/*BulkMentions*.xlsx

# --- Build / QA artifacts ---
skeleton/
output.pptx
slide-*.jpg
*.pdf.tmp
*.pyc
__pycache__/
.DS_Store

# --- Per-cycle deliverables (kept out of the knowledge repo) ---
*_Sprint_Room.pptx

# --- Monthly-run generated work + per-cycle client inputs ---
monthly-run/work/
monthly-run/inputs/*
!monthly-run/inputs/README.md
